  "description": "SONAX Rim Beast Wheel Cleaner Limited Edition 500ml |... - Distributed/Packaged by Sonax. Product Details: SONAX Rim Beast Wheel Cleaner Limited Edition 500ml |... - Distributed/Packaged by Sonax. Product Details: SONAX Rim Beast Wheel Cleaner Limited Edition 500ml | Color-Changing Formula | Premium Shining Wheels | Chrome, Aluminum, Steel, Clear-Coated & Painted | Remove Tough Dirt Brake Dust | Art. 04332000 - Distributed/Packaged by Sonax. Product Details: Advanced Wheel Cleaner: Powerful, acid-free, and pH-balanced formula safely cleans steel, aluminum, chrome, and alloy rims without damaging wheel surfaces. Color-Changing Formula: Sprays on clear and turns red/purple as it dissolves brake dust and grime, offering a visual cue that it’s working effectively. Safe on All Factory Wheels: Suitable for various finishes including Chrome, Aluminum, Steel, Clear-Coated, PVD, Painted, Plastic Wheel Covers, and Magnesium. Easy to Use: Ready to use, no dilution required. Just spray on cool, dry wheels, let sit for 3-5 minutes, and rinse with a high-pressure water jet for shiny, clean rims. Gentle Yet Effective: Attaches to and emulsifies stubborn, baked-on brake dust without harsh detergents. Safe for wheels with TPMS (Tire Pressure Monitoring Systems). Professional Results: Ideal for DIY enthusiasts and professionals, achieving showroom-quality wheels with minimal effort. Brush for Tough Dirt: Use with a wheel brush to remove especially stubborn dirt. Protective gloves recommended during application.",
